From e4d988bc89772647e7df1e24272f0d214db6d4b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HNO3Miracle <xiangao.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 13:21:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tests: require opt-in for live API tests

Mark examples that access the OUTSCALE API as integration tests. Also skip
credential-dependent configuration tests unless OSC_RUN_LIVE_TESTS is
explicitly enabled, while retaining all offline unit tests.

Signed-off-by: HNO3Miracle <xiangao.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
